What is taken from them here: of each REST operation, its HTTP method, host,
path, x-github category and operationId; of each root field of the schema's
query and mutation types, its name and @docsCategory
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/github_operations.json, written by
internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/catalogsgen from the sources
catalog_sources.json pins). Nothing else of either is kept. The catalog of
actions made from that list is Hypomnema's own
(internal/controlplane/serviceproxy/github.go).

